  "title": "Broadstone Net Lease Announces Two Additional Build-to-Suit Developments for $62.1 million",
  "summary": "VICTOR, N.Y. – Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. (NYSE: BNL) (“BNL”, the “Company”, “we”, “our”, or “us”), today announced it has added two new development projects to its pipeline of build-to-suit commitments. These projects represent an aggregate estimated total project investment of approximately $62.1 million. “We are excited to announce two new build-to-suit developments that demonstrate […]",
